---
title: Sequence Diagrams — Installment (Automation) and Income Verification
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AUTO as Chainlink Automation
    participant SC as LocalBank Contract
    participant U as Borrower
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    rect rgb(242,242,242)
        Note over AUTO,DB: (a) Installment payment — Automation checkUpkeep
        AUTO->>SC: checkUpkeep() — due installment?
        alt Upkeep needed
            SC->>SC: performUpkeep() — mark overdue
            SC-->>API: emit InstallmentDue(loanId, N)
            API->>DB: UPDATE installment SET status=DUE
            API-->>U: Push reminder notification
        end
        U->>FE: Pay installment N (USDC)
        FE->>API: POST /installments/N/pay (signed)
        API->>SC: processInstallment(loanId, N)
        SC->>SC: CEI: check → mark paid → accrue interest
        SC-->>API: emit InstallmentPaid(loanId, N)
        API->>DB: UPDATE installment SET status=PAID
        API-->>U: Receipt + next due date
        Note over SC: Last installment → LoanClosed + SBT update
    end

    rect rgb(226,226,226)
        Note over U,DB: (b) Income verification — doc hash only on-chain
        U->>FE: Upload income document
        FE->>API: POST /income { doc | bankToken }
        alt Open-Banking pull
            API->>API: Fetch transactions (read-only)
        else Manual review
            API->>API: Queue for LB Operator
        end
        API->>DB: INSERT income_proof (doc_hash, method)
        Note over API,SC: Only SHA-256 doc_hash on-chain — no PII
        API-->>U: Verified · SBT credit_score bumped
    end
